OL,3,A'Flat', 'tired', 'cynical': Unusually
OL,4,Agloomy Kiwis deliver New Zealand's
OL,5,Atightest election in years
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew Zealand voted in a new government
OL,8,Fas fog choked the capital, Wellington,
OL,9,Fon Saturday - and the mood was as
OL,10,Fpalpable as the grey weather.
OL,12,F"It's pretty flat," 21-year-old Imogen
OL,13,FVlutger says. "There's this kind of
OL,14,Fapathy and a bit of dread."
OL,16,F"Tired. I think we're all tired,"
OL,17,FSymone, 28, admits.
OL,19,F"I didn't even vote," one man in his
OL,20,F40s sheepishly confesses. He couldn't
OL,21,Fbring himself to tick any of the boxes,
OL,22,Fhe explains, declining to chat further.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
